FizzBuzz Souffle.

A recipe that serves the numbers one through one hundred, substituting
Fizz for multiples of three, Buzz for multiples of five, and FizzBuzz
for multiples of fifteen.

Ingredients.
1 g counter
3 g fizz divisor
5 g buzz divisor
15 g fizzbuzz divisor
100 g limit
70 g F
105 g i
122 g z
66 g B
117 g u
10 g newline

Method.
Put newline into mixing bowl.
Put z into mixing bowl.
Put z into mixing bowl.
Put u into mixing bowl.
Put B into mixing bowl.
Put z into mixing bowl.
Put z into mixing bowl.
Put i into mixing bowl.
Put F into mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
